msgid "启动契约"
msgstr "Boot Contract"

msgid "固件与交接"
msgstr "Firmware and Handoff"

msgid ""
"同一 kernel.sys 包含 Multiboot2 BIOS 32 位入口与 EFI64 入口。 BIOS 入口检查 CPU 能力、建立页表与栈后进入共享 64 位内核。 "
"解析交接数据时检查边界、对齐、长度和溢出；EFI 信息指针保留完整宽度。 固件、GRUB 与模块载荷需满足该协议，本仓不生成 ISO 或安装引导器。"
msgstr ""
"The same kernel.sys contains both a Multiboot2 BIOS 32-bit entry and an EFI64 entry. The BIOS "
"entry checks CPU capabilities and sets up page tables and a stack before entering the shared "
"64-bit kernel. Handoff data parsing checks bounds, alignment, lengths, and overflow; EFI "
"information pointers retain their full width. Firmware, GRUB, and module payloads must satisfy "
"this protocol. This repository does not generate an ISO or install a bootloader."

msgid "根分区"
msgstr "Root Partition"

msgid ""
"设备发现后解析显式 ``root=PARTUUID=...``，匹配唯一 GPT 分区身份。 畸形、缺失或重复请求拒绝自动回退；连接顺序不能替代指定身份。 "
"旧自动发现行为与显式选择是不同路线。内核映像和引导模块的内存范围 在物理内存管理初始化前保留，不能当作可重用空闲页。"
msgstr ""
"After device discovery, an explicit ``root=PARTUUID=...`` is parsed to match a unique GPT "
"partition identity. Malformed, missing, or duplicate requests reject automatic fallback; "
"connection order cannot replace the specified identity. Legacy automatic discovery and explicit "
"selection are separate paths. Memory ranges occupied by the kernel image and boot modules are "
"reserved before physical memory management is initialized and must not be treated as reusable free"
" pages."

msgid "日志"
msgstr "Logging"

msgid "内核日志使用 ``[启动后秒数] [等级] [组件] 消息`` 格式。默认保留 INFO、WARN、ERROR 和 FATAL。常见的进程启动、退出、回收及硬件缺席记录仅在 DEBUG 下输出。``debug`` 或 ``loglevel=8`` 开启 DEBUG，``quiet`` 等效于 ``loglevel=4``。``loglevel=N`` 接受 0–8，输出优先级数值小于 N 的记录。FATAL 和 panic 始终保留紧急输出。"
msgstr "Kernel records use ``[seconds since boot] [level] [component] message``. INFO, WARN, ERROR, and FATAL are enabled by default. Routine process launches, exits, reaping, and absent hardware are visible at DEBUG. Use ``debug`` or ``loglevel=8`` to enable DEBUG. ``quiet`` is equivalent to ``loglevel=4``. ``loglevel=N`` accepts 0–8 and emits priorities numerically below N. Emergency FATAL and panic output remains enabled."

msgid "``log=screen,serial`` 是默认值。可用 ``log=screen`` 或 ``log=serial`` 只选一个日志目标，也可用 ``log=none`` 关闭常规内核日志。``logcolor=0`` 关闭普通日志颜色。``bootlog-pause=1`` 在启动检查点等待输入。``syscall-trace=/path/prefix`` 为匹配的程序启用系统调用诊断。"
msgstr "``log=screen,serial`` is the default. Use ``log=screen`` or ``log=serial`` for a single log sink, or ``log=none`` to disable regular kernel records. ``logcolor=0`` disables regular log colors. ``bootlog-pause=1`` waits for input at a boot checkpoint. ``syscall-trace=/path/prefix`` enables syscall diagnostics for matching programs."

msgid "COM1 使用 115200 波特、8N1。早期启动和 panic 使用有界轮询。进入用户态后，内核日志和控制台镜像进入 32 KiB 发送队列，由 IRQ4 批量填充 UART FIFO，定时器负责兜底。队列为 WARN 和 ERROR 预留空间。积压清空后，串口报告丢弃的日志和控制台镜像数量。直接写入 ``/dev/ttyS0`` 时，阻塞写等待可用空间，非阻塞写在无法接收任何字节时返回 ``EAGAIN``。关闭或重启系统前会尝试发送队列中的数据。"
msgstr "COM1 uses 115200 baud, 8N1. Early boot and panic use bounded polling. After entering userspace, kernel logs and console mirroring use a 32 KiB transmit queue. IRQ4 fills the UART FIFO in batches, and the timer provides a fallback. The queue reserves space for WARN and ERROR. After the backlog drains, serial output reports the number of dropped records and console chunks. Blocking writes to ``/dev/ttyS0`` wait for space. Nonblocking writes return ``EAGAIN`` when no input bytes fit. Shutdown and reboot attempt to flush the queue."

msgid "文字控制台使用现有 framebuffer 字形、pitch 和原生 RGB 转换，可处理带行间填充的帧缓冲。"
msgstr "The text console uses the existing framebuffer glyphs, pitch, and native RGB conversion and supports framebuffers with row padding."
